```console
$ scherzo-cloud connection linear --help
Manage Linear workspace connections

Usage: scherzo-cloud connection linear [COMMAND]

Commands:
  authorization  Manage Linear authorization sessions
  delete         Delete a Linear connection and release its workspace
  list           List Linear connections
  remove         Remove a Linear connection credential and reserve its workspace
  show           Show a Linear connection and its authorization state
  help           Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
